Changes:
 qt6-base (6.11.2+dfsg-5+stereo3d1) unstable; urgency=medium
 .
   * Sparky Stereo OS: stereo for Qt programs on Wayland.
     QSurfaceFormat::StereoBuffers had no effect there, so QOpenGLWidget
     never rendered its right buffer. Two patches for the Wayland client:
     stereo-wayland-egl-two-views creates the EGL window surface with two
     views (EGL_EXT_multiview_window) and reports stereo in the window
     and context formats; stereo-wayland-no-csd-stereo-window draws no
     client side decorations around a stereo OpenGL window (they render
     the content into a mono FBO).
